*** Keywords ***
Check If Any Test Model Is Active
    [Documentation]
    ...  Checks if any Test Model is active using admin API. Common version for NR and LTE, both for TDD and FDD
    ...  Keyword result depending on ${should_be_active} argument:
    ...  If ${should_be_active} is ${True} and any test is active, keyword will pass, otherwise will fail.
    ...  If ${should_be_active} is ${False} and any test is active, keyword will fail, otherwise will pass.

    [Arguments]  ${connection}
    ...          ${should_be_active}
    ...          ${timeout}=20

    ${active_tm}                                            tm_common_adm.get_active_tests
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    Robot Log Variable                                      Active test models: ${active_tm}

    Run keyword if    ${should_be_active}                   Should Not Be Empty
    ...                                                     ${active_tm}
    ...                                                     msg=Current active Test Models list is empty: ${active_tm}
    ...               ELSE                                  Should Be Empty
    ...                                                     ${active_tm}
    ...                                                     msg=Current active Test Models list is not empty: ${active_tm}


Check If Test Model Is Active
    [Documentation]
    ...  Checks whether the Test Model with specific name is active using the admin API.
    ...  This is a common version for both NR and LTE, and applies to both TDD and FDD.
    ...  The keyword result depends on the ${should_be_active} argument: by default, it checks if the test is active.

    [Arguments]  ${admin_test_name}
    ...          ${connection}
    ...          ${cell_id}=${None}
    ...          ${should_be_active}=${True}
    ...          ${timeout}=20

    ${active_tm}                                            tm_common_adm.get_active_tests
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}

    ${is_active}=                                           Run keyword if    ${cell_id}
    ...  Evaluate       any('${admin_test_name}' == tm['testInfo'] and int(${cell_id}) == tm['cellId'] for tm in ${active_tm})
    ...  ELSE
    ...  Evaluate       '${admin_test_name}' in [tm['testInfo'] for tm in ${active_tm}]

    Should be true                                          ${is_active}==${should_be_active}
    ...                                                     msg=Test ${admin_test_name} is active: ${is_active}, should be active: ${should_be_active}

    ${msg}=                                                 Evaluate   'active' if ${should_be_active} else 'not active'
    Robot Log Result                                        Test Model ${admin_test_name} is ${msg}
